# Invariant ignores shared across every project in this monorepo - OS/editor churn and generic
# build-tool caches that look the same regardless of which project produced them. Project-specific
# output paths (APK layout, wails' build/bin, this app's own data/archive dirs, etc.) stay in that
# project's own .gitignore instead (git applies both automatically within one repo - no config
# needed) - only move a pattern here if it would apply unchanged in any project of that general
# kind (any JVM project, any project touched on a Mac, etc.).

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors / IDEs
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Java / Gradle (Android today, any future JVM tooling)
.gradle/
*.class

# Native build caches (Android NDK / CMake)
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/

# Node/npm-based frontend tooling
node_modules/

# Generic
*.log

# Claude Code session-local state (not project source)
.claude/*.lock
